    text: "Affected southbound trips:\r\n8:48 am from Union Station Track 12\r\n10:33 am from Union Station Track 12\r\n12:18 pm from Union Station Track 12\r\n2:03 pm from Union Station Track 12\r\n3:48 pm from Union Station Track 12\r\n5:33 pm from Union Station Track 12\r\n\nAffected northbound trips:\r\n9:52 am from Littleton / Mineral Ave Station\r\n11:37 am from Littleton / Mineral Ave Station\r\n1:22 pm from Littleton / Mineral Ave Station\r\n3:07 pm from Littleton / Mineral Ave Station\r\n4:52 pm from Littleton / Mineral Ave Station"
